sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as .NET backend
    participant A as FastAPI AI API
    participant D as Durable store
    participant Q as Redis/RQ
    participant W as Worker
    F->>B: Start analysis
    B->>A: POST /internal/jobs
    A->>D: Validate fingerprint and persist
    A->>Q: Queue work / cache transient input
    A-->>B: 202 QUEUED or idempotent/conflict
    Q->>W: Execute attempt
    W->>W: Recover source and run 15-node graph
    W->>D: Persist chunks, evidence, quality and result
    W-->>B: Optional callback after persistence
    B->>A: Poll status/result
    A->>D: Read durable state
    A-->>B: Status / JobResult
    B-->>F: Normalized result and evidence
